					"nextDialogs": [
						412130504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130504,
					"content": "砂糖，妳不是在整理資料嗎？怎麼突然跑到這種地方來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130505,
					"content": "而且還在冰天雪地裡和這麼危險的對手作戰…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130506,
					"content": "我、我也作戰了，對不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130507,
					"content": "為什麼連我也跟著心虛起來了呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130508,
					"content": "嗚啊啊我、我只是…對不起對不起，我就是路過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130509,
					"content": "唉，我猜，一定又有什麼讓妳感興趣的東西出現了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130510,
					"content": "我把劍的事告訴砂糖了，抱歉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130511
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130511,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}都告訴她了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130512,
					"content": "只是說了劍的屬性和來歷，沒有讓她觸摸本體！這點意識我們還是有的嘛~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130513,
					"content": "算了，本來也不可能瞞她多久。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130514,
					"content": "砂糖對知識和秘密很有探究精神，確實適合做煉金術研究。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130515,
					"content": "啊嗚嗚…我再也不敢亂惹麻煩了！用我新研究的四倍大種籽甜甜花發誓！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130516,
					"content": "我不怕麻煩，只是擔心你們的安全。下次千萬注意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130517,
					"content": "對了，那個蹲在那裡的冒險家是怎麼回事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130518,
					"content": "剛才戰鬥中我負責保護帕拉德先生，我想，他應該沒有受傷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130519,
					"content": "冷…冷死我了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "冒失的帕拉德"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130520,
					"content": "好像是在剛才的戰鬥中著涼了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130521,
					"content": "啊啊，這倒是沒想到…是我疏忽了，非常抱歉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130522,
					"content": "阿貝多先生，我去看看他的情況！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130523,
					"content": "嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130524,
					"content": "砂糖看起來有些死板，居然是個很有愛心的好孩子呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130525,
					"content": "不要叫比妳大的人孩子哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130526
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130526,
					"content": "說得也是呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130527,
					"content": "砂糖這傢伙，一不小心就會跑到奇怪的地方去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130528,
					"content": "年輕人都這樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130529
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130529,
					"content": "也是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130530,
					"content": "砂糖不是故意的，請不要生氣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130531
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130531,
					"content": "放心吧，我沒生氣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130532,
					"content": "哎？劍上面好像有什麼東西在閃爍呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130533,
					"content": "嗯？又有變化…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130534,
					"content": "劍上的力量比之前強大了不少。怎麼回事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130535,
					"content": "我們和愚人眾發生了戰鬥。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130536
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412130536,
					"content": "這一帶的愚人眾士兵裡有些我們沒見過的狠角色哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130537,
					"content": "是之前沒有遇到過的力量嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412130538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412130538,
					"content": "所以，劍也大幅成長了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				}
			]
		},
		{
